  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "えんとつやまで　てにいれた　いんせき。\nほのかな　ひかりを　はなちつづけている。\nふれると　じんわり　あたたかい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "굴뚝산에서 손에 넣은 운석.\n은은한 빛을 계속해서 발하고 있다.\n만지면 은근히 따뜻하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在煙囪山上獲得的隕石。\n持續散發著微微光芒。\n摸起來有點暖暖的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une météorite trouvée au Mont Chimnée.\nElle émet une faible lueur de façon continue,\net est légèrement tiède au toucher.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Meteorit, den du beim Schlotberg erhalten hast.\nVon ihm geht ein schwaches Licht aus. Wenn man\nihn berührt, wird er warm.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorito obtenido en el Monte Cenizo. Sigue\ndesprendiendo un tenue brillo y es ligeramente\ncálido al tacto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorite ottenuto sul Monte Camino.\nEmette una debole luminescenza.\nToccandolo, si avverte un certo calore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Meteorite that you got at Mt. Chimney.\nIt continues to give off a faint glow and is slightly\nwarm to the touch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "えんとつ山で　手に入れた　いんせき。\nほのかな　光を　放ち続けている。\n触れると　じんわり　暖かい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在烟囱山上获得的陨石。\n持续散发着微光。\n摸上去隐约有点暖暖的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
